# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DeepLabCut project: track only config.yaml and the hand labels.
#
# Not tracked (all regenerable):
#   cheetah-dlc/videos/                  symlinks into data/
#   cheetah-dlc/training-datasets/       rebuilt by create_training_dataset
#   cheetah-dlc/dlc-models*/             trained weights (copy with rsync)
#   cheetah-dlc/evaluation-results*/     rebuilt by evaluate_network
#   labeled-data/*_labeled/              drawn by check_labels
#   labeled-data/*/img*.png              rebuilt by scripts/labeling/rebuild_frames.py
#
# Keep this block last: its "!" rules override *.h5 above.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
cheetah-dlc/*
!cheetah-dlc/config.yaml
!cheetah-dlc/labeled-data/
cheetah-dlc/labeled-data/*/*
!cheetah-dlc/labeled-data/*/CollectedData_*.h5
!cheetah-dlc/labeled-data/*/CollectedData_*.csv
cheetah-dlc/labeled-data/*_labeled/
